{"unit_id":"Lhy723__dsh-self-evolution#card-zh","repo":"Lhy723/dsh-self-evolution","commit":"ff3d231edb1aeb5516e4645981ba30580787d840","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-self-evolution 是 DeepSeek Harness 的 Agent Profile 基准评测与迭代插件。它注册四个 evolution 工具，使用子 Agent 执行任务、评测和候选优化。用户可在冻结 Benchmark 上建立基线、生成并评估 Profile 修改，只接受严格优于基线的候选，并保存快照以便回滚。适合通过重复基准任务改进 Agent 指令、技能和运行配置。需要已配置 tools 与 subagents 的 DSH Profile 及 Node.js 22 以上版本；状态默认保存在 ~/.dsh/self-evolution。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/runtime.ts:122-143","src/runtime.ts:166-179","src/engine.ts:77-100","src/config.ts:47-70","cordis.patch.yml:12-29"]}
